  "description": "OrionGuard is a modern, fluent, and extensible validation library for .NET applications.\n\t\t\tFeatures: ThrowHelper-optimized guards, span-based FastGuard, security guards (SQL/XSS/Path Traversal),\n\t\t\tuniversal format guards, thread-safe localization, compiled expression caching, and Result pattern.",
